      "archive_score": 1136,
      "archive_comments": 228,
      "score_source": "algolia",
      "comments_source": "algolia",
      "checked_at": "2026-11-18T10:38:15Z",
      "current_dead": null,
      "current_deleted": null,
      "current_title": "I don't learn anything on HN anymore, bring back the upvote count",
      "excerpt": "I know 1500 people have said this before, but today I guess I'm the one who hit the boiling point. The value of HN, from the perspective of simply learning, has been destroyed for me since upvotes were hidden. When I first started reading HN I learned a TON very quickly and everyday about completely new stuff, and was able to do so because I could easily sort through the legitimacy of opinions based on their upvotes. Yes, the upvote system wasn't perfect, but it's a piece of",
      "rank": 1,
      "guide_zh": "用户认为隐藏赞数降低了学习价值，呼吁恢复显示。"
    },
